# The Heart of the Matter (Windurst 1-2): the orbs lost. A level 10 Warrior of Windurst with 1-2 current at status 5 and
# the six Glowing Mana Orbs (a GM). The zone-in of East Sarutabaruta plays 48, whose finish takes the six orbs and sets
# status 6. Status 6: Pore-Ohre and Quh Berhuja say their stolen-orbs text; Apururu of Windurst Woods plays 143, whose
# finish completes the mission (250 rank points). Rival zone-in: entering Windurst Woods plays the Seekers of Adventure
# mission Rumors from the West, 839 (another mission's script, not this one); its finish writes that mission's status 4
# (area 12).
lists EastSarutabaruta/onZoneIn/1 EastSarutabaruta/onEventFinish/48 EastSarutabaruta/Pore-Ohre/onTrigger EastSarutabaruta/Quh_Berhuja/onTrigger WindurstWoods/Apururu/onTrigger WindurstWoods/onEventFinish/143
char zone=WindurstWoods pos=-11,-2,13 job=WAR lvl=10 nation=2
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Windurst TheHeartOfTheMatter current
login
missionstatus Windurst 5                # a GM
keyitem FirstGlowingManaOrb             # a GM
keyitem SecondGlowingManaOrb            # a GM
keyitem ThirdGlowingManaOrb             # a GM
keyitem FourthGlowingManaOrb            # a GM
keyitem FifthGlowingManaOrb             # a GM
keyitem SixthGlowingManaOrb             # a GM
warp 258,-17,-440 EastSarutabaruta open # the Cardians take the orbs: 48
finish                                  # the six orbs taken, status 6
trigger Pore-Ohre                       # PORE_OHRE_STOLEN_ORBS
trigger Quh_Berhuja                     # QUH_BERHUJA_STOLEN_ORBS
warp -11,-2,13 WindurstWoods
trigger Apururu                         # status 6: 143
finish                                  # completed (250 rank points)
